 "lore": {
  "intro": "Hydroponics. The torus keeps the greens\nalive. The greens are dying in a spiral.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: The torus is a half-ring. Walk it out and back, check the feeders."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:5",
    "text": "Ratio: End cap. Turn around when you're done."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:7",
    "text": "Ratio: Hold on. Your suit gyro says you're facing spinward. You entered anti-spinward. Say something so I know you're you."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:1",
    "text": "Ratio: Feeder pressure is nominal in sector two. First nominal reading I've had all month. Enjoy it."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "pickup:blue",
    "text": "Ratio: Blue seal, from the end cap. The garden airlock takes it. Back the way you came \u2014 or, apparently, straight ahead. Both work. Neither should."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "kills:8",
    "text": "Ratio: That big one read twice your mass. The station manifest has nothing that shape."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: I plotted your walk. The turns sum to half a circle, and you got home anyway. Logging it as... no. Not logging it."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 7,
    "pos": [
     483,
     -20
    ],
    "text": "BOTANY NOTE\nThe cucumbers grow clockwise here.\nIn the seed manual they grow counterclockwise.\nSame seeds. Same water.\nI stopped writing this up."
   },
   {
    "room": 8,
    "pos": [
     -337,
     150
    ],
    "text": "INVENTORY\n2x fertilizer drum \u2014 MISSING.\nFound both drums in the room I was standing in.\nBehind me. I had checked behind me."
   },
   {
    "room": 1,
    "pos": [
     176.7766952966369,
     -176.77669529663686
    ],
    "text": "DIRECTIVE 0007 \u2014 MIRIAD PRIME\nRE: survey of gravitational anomaly, Site One\n\nRETRIEVAL SUPERSEDES SURVEY.\n\n[appended, local, unsigned]\nFour months of careful science, inverted overnight\nby three words. We cut the aperture Tuesday.\nGod help whoever reads this log in order."
   },
   {
    "room": 4,
    "pos": [
     204.78801107224794,
     143.3941090877615
    ],
    "text": "FEEDER SCHEDULE, SECTOR 5\n0400 nutrient, 0900 mist, 1400 nutrient,\n1900 mist, 0000 dark cycle.\nThe dying trays spiral inward, sunwise.\nThe healthy trays spiral the other way.\nBotany says plants do not have a 'way'."
   }
  ]
 }
